[init]
<$Config,knight=1>
<$Config,squire=1>

[@1]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>Our retreat is being blocked!!  
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@2]
~l~I You shout to the Knight:
<p>~N~.~wQuick try to flank them!  
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@3]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>I can't!!!  I've been surrounded....I'll try to get out.....
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@60]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>Blast!! It's no use!  I'm being overwhelmed by their attacks!!
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

[@61]
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
<p>We can't stay here!!  The Elementals will catch up with us within the hour!!!
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@62]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>Save yourselves!!  Go without me!!
$Timeout=5,DoNothing,0

$Button=Leave...,Tell,leave
$Button=No...,DoNothing,0
$Timeout=6,Tell,stay

[@300]
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
<p>I think we have 55 more minutes till the Elementals reach us.
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@301]
<p>Which means we have 3/4 of an hour to save the Knight...
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@302]
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
<p>You think we will reach our territory with a ten minute head start?
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@303]
<p>Let's not think about what will happen if it isn't enough...
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@304]
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
<p>You should put the Knight on your island when we fall back.  Mine may not make it out of here.
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@1200]
~I~lYou glance at the sun's posistion.....Only one half hour left.....
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@2160]
~l~IFourteen minutes left........
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@2700]
~l~IFive minutes left....you begin to sweat and feel your heart pounding.....
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@3000]
<?!{knight}>
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
We can't stay here any longer!  The Elementals are aproaching!
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0
</?>
<?!{squire}>
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
We must leave the squire behind or the Elementals will trap and destroy all of us!
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0

[@3001]
<?!{knight}>
~l~IWe just can't LEAVE!
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0
</?>

<?!{squire}>
Blast!  We can't afford to lose any more allies and friends!
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0
</?>


[@3002]
<?!{knight}>
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
We have no choice...it's either we leave to fight another day or perish!
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0
</?>

<?!{squire}>
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
Our clan will be destroyed if both of us perish!  The squire made a sacrafice here today...we must live to tell others about it.
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0
</?>

[@3003]
<?!{knight}>
~l~I......
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0
</?>

<?!{squire}>
~l~IFarewell my friend....I'm sorry.....You will not be forgoten!
$Timeout=10,DoNothing,0
</?>

[@3004]
<?!{knight}>
~l~I....Your right......I'm sorry Knight....I'll be back for you!

<$Config,Donetnron433=1>
<$Config,Donetnron43=0>
<$Config,Donetnron53=0>
<$Config,Donetnron63=0>
<$Config,Donetnron73=0>
<$Config,Donetnron83=0>
<$Config,tnron0433=1>


$Timeout=10,MissionBegin,tnron53
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron53
</?>

<?!{squire}>
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
~l~IWe must hurry we still have to out manuver what's left of the Flyers...goodbye friend...

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<$Config,Donetnron433=0>
<$Config,Donetnron54=0>
<$Config,Donetnron64=0>
<$Config,Donetnron74=0>
<$Config,Donetnron84=0>
<$Config,tnron043=1>

$Timeout=10,MissionBegin,tnron53
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron53
</?>

[stay]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>I'll take your silence as no you won't go....
$Timeout=4,DoNothing,0

[leave]
<$Config,Donetnron433=1>
<$Config,Donetnron43=0>
<$Config,Donetnron53=0>
<$Config,Donetnron63=0>
<$Config,Donetnron73=0>
<$Config,Donetnron83=0>
<$Config,tnron0433=1>

$Timeout=0,MissionBegin,tnron53

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Retreat</h2>
<i>"Advance backwards!!  We don't retreat men!"<br>
--Varkol Adex, Nimbian General.</i>  
<p>Forced to retreat or face certain doom after failing to dispatch the Elemental's scouts, your path of retreat has been blocked off.
<p>You have to get through the barriacde or you shall be greatly outnumbered and outgunned.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<h2>Success!</h2>
<p>YOU CHEATER YOU!!!  Or so I assume =)

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<$Config,Donetnron433=0>
<$Config,Donetnron54=0>
<$Config,Donetnron64=0>
<$Config,Donetnron74=0>
<$Config,Donetnron84=0>
<$Config,tnron043=1>

$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron53

[ai2TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~rMaster of the Man o'Wars</h2>
<p>
You can't win this battle!  It's hopeless!  Surrender now!

[ai2TempleDead]
<h2>~rMaster of the Man o'Wars</h2>
<p>
Gaaa!!! NO!  I may fall but you shall two in the end!

[ai3TempleDead]
<h2>~lKing of the Flyers</h2>
<p>
How can this be!?!?!?

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gLord of the Flyers</h2>
<p>
Retreat now fools!  Our allies the Elementals will be here soon.  Granted they'll make short work of you!

[ai5TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~mDuke of the Flyers</h2>
<p>
Argh!!  How can you get past my defence's??  HOW?!?!

[ai6TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~yLeader of the Whirligigs</h2>
<p>That's right waste your time on me!  You will not make it out of here alive! HAHAHAH!

[ai7PriestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Flyers</h2>
<p>
Heh heh....We got ourselves a prisoner.
<$Config,knight=0>
$Button=Ok,Tell,cap
$Timeout=3,Tell,cap

[ai7PriestSaved]
<?!{squire}>
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>Thank you but we must now save the squire!
</?>
<?{squire}>
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>Thank you.  Now let's get out of here!
<$Config,knight=1>

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<$Config,Donetnron433=0>
<$Config,Donetnron54=0>
<$Config,Donetnron64=0>
<$Config,Donetnron74=0>
<$Config,Donetnron84=0>
<$Config,tnron043=1>

$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron53
</?>



[cap]
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
<p>We have to save him!
$Button=Ok,Tell,cap2
$Timeout=3,Tell,cap2

[cap2]
<h2>Message from the Flyers</h2>
<p>
We doubt it!  Our new allies the Elementals are on their way here!
$Button=Ok,Tell,cap3
$Timeout=3,Tell,cap3

[cap3]
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>They are too strong!!!  Go before we are all doomed!!!
$Button=No,Tell,cap4
$Button=Leave,Tell,leave
$Timeout=3,Tell,cap4

[cap4]
No we are staying!!!
$Button=Ok,Tell,cap5
$Timeout=2,Tell,cap5

[cap5]
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
<p>We won't leave without you!

[ai8PriestSaved]
<?!{knight}>
<h2>~oSquire of Rain</h2>
<p>Ok now that you've saved me, lets get the Knight out of there.
</?>
<?{knight}>
<h2>~gKnight of Wind</h2> 
<p>Ok ok let's go!
<$Config,squire=1>

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
<$Config,Donetnron433=0>
<$Config,Donetnron54=0>
<$Config,Donetnron64=0>
<$Config,Donetnron74=0>
<$Config,Donetnron84=0>
<$Config,tnron043=1>

$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,tnron53
</?>

[ai8riestCaptured]
<h2>Message from the Flyers</h2>
<p>
This is a good day!  Yet another prisioner!
<$Config,squire=0>

[Failed]
